      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحجّن</span></b>  <i>It was,</i> or <i>became, crooked,</i> [or
<i>hooked,</i>] or <i>curved:</i> (T, K:) said of a thing that
is termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْجَنُ</span>. (T.)

